Bundled artwork
===============

GHS pictograms (app/src/chemica/web/static/ghs/*.svg)
    The official hazard pictograms of the Globally Harmonized System of
    Classification and Labelling of Chemicals, published by the United
    Nations Economic Commission for Europe (UNECE). UNECE permits their
    reproduction for the purpose of hazard communication; the pictogram
    designs themselves are not subject to copyright restriction, though
    the GHS framework text is (c) United Nations.
    Reference: https://unece.org/transport/dangerous-goods/ghs-pictograms

favicon.svg (app/src/chemica/web/static/favicon.svg)
    Original artwork created for Chemica; licensed under AGPL-3.0-only
    with the rest of the repository.

