Data sources
============

Compound data is fetched at runtime from public APIs and is not
redistributed with this repository:

- PubChem (NIH/NLM) — structures, properties, identifiers, GHS data.
- Wikipedia (Wikimedia Foundation) — article text under CC BY-SA 4.0.
- PsychonautWiki — dosage, duration, and interaction data under CC BY-SA 4.0.
- PubMed (NIH/NLM) — bibliographic records via NCBI Entrez, subject to the
  NCBI Web-usage guidelines.
